        NODE[Node.js API<br/>Express]
        MONGO[MongoDB<br/>User Data]
    end

    LMS --> CONTENT
    CONTENT --> VIDEO
    VIDEO --> INTERACTIVE
    INTERACTIVE --> QUIZZES
    QUIZZES --> COMPLETION
    COMPLETION --> CERTIFICATES
    CERTIFICATES --> ANALYTICS
    ANALYTICS --> REACT
    REACT --> NODE
    NODE --> MONGO

